@startuml Tourist_Trip_Archive_SSD

actor "Tourist" as Tourist
participant "UI: Trip Archive" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "S3 Storage" as S3

== View Trip Archive ==

Tourist -> UI: Access trip archive page
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch visited sites
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return visited sites with itinerary info
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch user's reviews
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return reviews
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Display two tabs:\n- Places Visited\n- My Reviews
deactivate UI

== Filter and Search Places ==

Tourist -> UI: Enter search term or select itinerary filter
activate UI

UI -> UI: Filter visited sites by:\n- Search (site name)\n- Itinerary name

UI --> Tourist: Display filtered places
deactivate UI

== View Place Details ==

Tourist -> UI: Click on visited place
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Expand to show:\n- Site image\n- Description\n- Visit date\n- Itinerary name\n- Rating (if reviewed)

deactivate UI

== Add/Edit Review ==

Tourist -> UI: Click "Add Review" or "Edit Review"
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Show review modal

Tourist -> UI: Enter/modify:\n- Star rating (1-5)\n- Review text\n- Upload photos (optional)

alt Upload photos
    Tourist -> UI: Select photos
    
    UI -> S3: Upload review photos
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return S3 URLs
    deactivate S3
    
    UI --> Tourist: Show photo previews
end

Tourist -> UI: Submit review

UI -> UI: Validate (rating required)

alt Input valid
    alt New review
        UI -> DB: Save review record
        activate DB
        DB --> UI: Review created
        deactivate DB
    else Edit existing
        UI -> DB: Update review record
        activate DB
        DB --> UI: Review updated
        deactivate DB
    end
    
    UI --> Tourist: Show success, close modal,\nrefresh lists
else Input invalid
    UI --> Tourist: Show validation error
end

deactivate UI

== Delete Review Photos ==

Tourist -> UI: Click delete on photo preview
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Show confirmation

Tourist -> UI: Confirm delete

UI -> S3: Delete photo from storage
activate S3
deactivate S3

UI --> Tourist: Remove photo from preview
deactivate UI

== View My Reviews ==

Tourist -> UI: Switch to "My Reviews" tab
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display all user reviews:\n- Site name\n- Rating (stars)\n- Review text preview\n- Photos\n- Date submitted

deactivate UI

== Filter and Search Reviews ==

Tourist -> UI: Enter search term or select itinerary filter
activate UI

UI -> UI: Filter reviews by:\n- Search (site name, review text)\n- Itinerary name

UI --> Tourist: Display filtered reviews
deactivate UI

== View Full Review ==

Tourist -> UI: Click on review
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Expand to show:\n- Full review text\n- All photos (gallery)\n- Site details\n- Submit date

deactivate UI

== Continue Itinerary ==

Tourist -> UI: Click "Go to Next Site"
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Navigate to itinerary map\n(resume at next unvisited site)

deactivate UI

@enduml
